   "summary": "Rules governing orchestration state: Tier 4 durability, checkpoint preservation, decision logging, deterministic rerun behaviour, conflict logging, the agent-memory boundary, the four-value validation status vocabulary (Confirmed, Inferred, Assumed, Unresolved) and index maintenance.",
   "tags": [
